<p><strong>Hash maps</strong><br>
<!-- -->A hash map would be a great way to solve this problem, as it allows=
 us to query specific values in constant time.</p>
<p>What we would need are two hash maps:</p>
<ul>
<li>A hash map that contains numbers to the left of each <code>x</code> (<c=
ode>left_map</code>).</li>
<li>A hash map that contains numbers to the right of each <code>x</code> (<=
code>right_map</code>).</li>
</ul>
